  partName: Cylinder Head
  description: The Cylinder Head, located at the middle-center-rear of the Hover
    Engine, is a large and complex-shaped component that sits atop the engine's cylinders
    and plays a crucial role in the combustion process. Made of standardSurface2
    material, it provides a durable and heat-resistant interface between the cylinders
    and the engine's valves. Notably, the Cylinder Head's design and material selection
    have a significant impact on the engine's power output, efficiency, and emissions.
